<title>NETHERLANDS: Rodamco first-half net down 6.25 percent.</title>
<headline>Rodamco first-half net down 6.25 percent.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Aug 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   210    vs 224</p>
<p>    Property revaluation gain	 19    vs   8</p>
<p>    Currency gain			 61    vs  42</p>
<p>Total income after revaluations</p>
<p>    and other items		    302    vs 271</p>
<p>NOTE - Rodamco NV, the property arm of the Robeco group of investment funds, previously said it expected net profits to fall fractionally in the financial year 1996/97.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
